{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55187","headline":"最後颂（一作「语」） · 智闲","name":"最後颂（一作「语」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有一语，全规矩，休思量（一作「惟」），不自许。\n路逢同（一作「达」）道人，杨眉省来处。\n踏不着，多疑虑，却思量（一作「看」），带伴侣。\n一生参学事无成，殷懃抱得栴檀树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智闲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}